{"c":[{"name":"20261008T030901Z-f494e5b78b4262d5","text":"INT1 (v2/int1): OWNER_NOTE_CHARS is 0 behind TODO(INT1) until HA2's allotment is re-expressed on the output-based ledger; the tests that need it are skipped or floored with TODO(INT1). grep TODO(INT1) to restore 2,000.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T053436Z-ced2cc8130be00ef","text":"Onboarding promise: PermissionsScreen.privacyLine reads bundle PrivacyPromise.txt (nil under swift run/xctest); renders and tests inject their own PrivacyPromise. CARET_VERIFY_PRIVACY_RESOURCE: gate refuses a finished app whose copy is missing, empty or not PRIVACY_PROMISE.","type":"note"}]}
